00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:21.750
Without a map, without a compass...

00:23:16.970 --> 00:23:21.270
Yang:

00:23:16.970 --> 00:23:21.270
Gouda Hozumi

00:23:22.260 --> 00:23:26.840
...we set out on a voyage

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:36.190
Not a journey to find something that's already been found

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:32.440
Kefenhiller:

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:32.440
Yajima Masaaki

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:37.080
Patorichev:

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:37.080
